1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,749
Welcome everyone to Oikos University!

2
00:00:03,749 --> 00:00:08,213
I am Professor Peter Kim, Director of Smart Insight Lab.

3
00:00:08,213 --> 00:00:18,420
Today, we inaugurate our flagship master curriculum: "The Architect of Intelligence: Mastering Agentic IT and Strategic Wisdom."

4
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,969
And a warm welcome to all our global students!

5
00:00:21,969 --> 00:00:26,057
I'm Sarah Jenkins, your Teaching Assistant and AI Research Fellow.

6
00:00:26,057 --> 00:00:34,360
Professor Kim and I have designed this 60-minute lecture specifically to take you from basic AI prompts to true architectural mastery.

7
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:54,980
Look at our opening title on the screen: "From Waiting Chatbots to Sleep-Free Personal Avatars." Over the past three years, the entire technology industry has been interacting with AI as a passive encyclopedia sitting on a desk—you type a question, wait for an answer, and copy the text manually.

8
00:00:55,680 --> 00:01:04,703
But in 2026, we are witnessing the biggest structural paradigm shift in computing: the transition to autonomous, sleep-free personal avatars.

9
00:01:04,703 --> 00:01:14,110
These are persistent software agents residing in the cloud, continuously monitoring data streams, and executing complex workflows around the clock.

10
00:01:14,810 --> 00:01:20,009
Our foundational guiding motto is "Soli Deo Gloria"—Glory to God alone.

11
00:01:20,009 --> 00:01:33,190
We teach this cutting-edge technology not merely to write more code, but to redeem finite human time, eliminate mechanical drudgery, and elevate human dignity and strategic wisdom.

12
00:01:33,890 --> 00:01:43,089
We have structured today's 60-minute lecture into three clear 20-minute modules so you can master both the conceptual revolution and the hands-on engineering.

13
00:01:43,089 --> 00:01:45,360
Let us embark on this journey together!

